00:08:55.201 --> 00:08:56.502
and in the theater district.

00:08:56.502 --> 00:08:57.003
They had it there.

00:08:57.003 --> 00:08:58.037
And it's just stuck right

00:08:58.037 --> 00:09:00.072
at 31.4 trillion.

00:09:00.072 --> 00:09:00.573
But you're right.

00:09:00.573 --> 00:09:01.340
