00:09:09.482 --> 00:09:11.551
or your senior citizens.

00:09:11.551 --> 00:09:12.919
Pell Grant. So much.

00:09:12.919 --> 00:09:13.586
All of it.

00:09:13.586 --> 00:09:14.954
Christine Romans, thank you so much.

